# HELPUS SECURITY & REPOSITORY SEGREGATION SHIELD (ORDER 036)
# ==============================================================================
# Prevent accidental leaks of binary packages, bundles and compiled PDFs
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Segregate private academic manuscripts and research prototypes
usenix-security-27/
usenix27*/
article/usenix27/
article/generated/

# Segregate private conference dossiers and proposal planning
docs/proposals/
first-2027/
proposals/

